CLAWD — MASCOT ATTRIBUTION AND TRADEMARK NOTICE
================================================================================

The MIT grant above covers the plugin's code and CSS.

It does NOT cover the Clawd mascot itself.

Clawd, the pixel crab, is a mascot for Anthropic's Claude Code. "Claude" and
"Anthropic" are trademarks of Anthropic PBC. This project is an unofficial fan
tribute with no affiliation with, endorsement by, or sponsorship from Anthropic.

The crab is drawn as pure CSS box-shadow pixel art; no image file of the mascot
is redistributed here. The pixel frame coordinates embedded in
lib/client.js were derived from the SillyTavern extension "Claude Web 2.0" by
claudenoshujin (github.com/claudenoshujin/claude-web). Credit for the original pixel
artwork belongs to that author.

This project reuses the geometry only. All selectors, keyframes, colour
mapping, mounting logic and interaction behaviour are original to this project,
and no file from that repository is copied.

If you redistribute this plugin, keep this attribution intact.
